create fresh owned parents and empty journal; bootstrap captures remain absent until the exact noclobber/read-write wrapper. No actual root or runtime slot file is created here.\\n\\nProspective actual:600s inclusive/setup60s/tail60s, case3s/TERM2/KILL1;7 managed(owner1+Bash6)+4 UNOBSERVED stage reservations(P22/P23 two each)+18 admin=29 proposed slots. Managed peak2+2 unobserved stage allowance+margin1=peak5. Not observed census or OS quota.64KiB/stream,32MiB capture,128MiB work. Exact six-key child environment, owned empty PATH, no BASH_ENV/ENV/exported functions, --noprofile --norc. Initial tool/zsh startup remains trusted host outside child clean-env/raw-capture qualification; no containment or GNU5.3 claim.\\n\\nActual recipe: DIFFERENT preexec ACCEPT, fresh committed runtime ROOT review/GO/preprovision and fixed UTC window, separate resolved sole-slot DATA review, then EXACT exec_command require_escalated/login:false/no prefix with sealed APPROVAL-PROPOSAL.template.json parameters. No automatic follow-on, old grant reuse or actual request.\\n\\nOld26/12/37 observations, accounting holds and ambiguities remain unchanged. These six unrun type probes are intended to distinguish startup/readonly indexed versus nonarray/local bindings; preparation alone resolves none. F05 timing and ordinary command-substitution source limits are not rescored.\\n`);"
